    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d716">

                <pb facs="1227" n="1180" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg1180"/>

                <head>716. Telegram 295 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d716-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-09-21">September 21, 1956, 6
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d716-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d716-1"/>
                <p>295. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Am making no press comment on CHICOM statement (my telegram 293). If Department
                    issues reply would appreciate prompt transmittal here.</p>
                <p>At tomorrow’s meeting plan ignore CHICOM’s statement unless raised by him and
                    proceed along lines Deptel 301.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Popper</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
